==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Poipole|102}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Forbidden Light|Poipole|55}} from the {{TCG|Forbidden Light}} expansion.
*The '''2-Step''' attack is named after {{wp|2-step garage}}, a genre of music. It may be a reference to {{p|Poipole}} being part of a two-stage evolutionary line, unlike all other [[Ultra Beast]]s.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

